ames></name><name><surname>Nussenzweig</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Plasmodium circumsporozoite protein promotes the development of the liver stages of the parasite.</article-title><source>Cell</source><volume>131</volume><fpage>492</fpage><lpage>504</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17981117</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests: </bold>The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>This research was supported by the following grants: Haldar (R01HL069630, R01AI039071, P01-PPG 5P01HL078826); Gomez (Alliance for Graduate Education and the Professoriate - AGEP).</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>